[[48,127,2147483648,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the vehicle on a ramp.</p><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nstop OFF, then disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235044\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection for the left Lambda sensor\nand release the electrical wiring from its attachments.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Lambda sensor on pre-catalyzer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236465\">K15</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the left Lambda sensor using a suitable spanner and remove\nit.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013686.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,2147483648,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the left Lambda sensor back in its\nhousing and tighten it to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>LEFT LAMBDA SENSOR</p></td><td><p>M18</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Left preconverter side) 4.0 ÷ 5.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\nleft Lambda sensor and secure the wiring.</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the battery terminal (-).</p><p>Remove the car from the ramp.</p>"],[6,127,2147483648,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF postition, then disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235044\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection for the left Lambda sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Lambda sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236523\">K39</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014206.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[6,127,2147483648,"<p>1. Undo and remove the left Lambda sensor.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014207.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[6,127,2147483648,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the left Lambda sensor back in its\nhousing and tighten it to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>LEFT LAMBDA SENSOR</p></td><td><p>M18</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Exhaust manifold side) 4.0 ÷ 5.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\nleft Lambda sensor.</p><p>Connect the battery terminal (-).</p>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF postition, then disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235044\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection for the left Lambda sensor\nand release it from the mounting bracket.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Lambda sensor on pre-catalyzer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236465\">K15</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo and remove the left Lambda sensor.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014707.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Place the left Lambda sensor back in its housing and tighten\nit to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>RIGHT LAMBDA SENSOR</p></td><td><p>M18</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.0 ÷ 5.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Connect the electrical connection for the left Lambda sensor\nand secure it to the mounting bracket.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014708.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<p>Connect the battery terminal (-).</p>"]]